---
// About section component
// Explains what Century Digital does using industry-specific language
---

<section id="about" class="w-full bg-white scroll-mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="section-inner flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
			<div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-4">
				<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">
					We're Here So You Can Win
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					You want to write more paper. The bottleneck is always the same: finding people who actually have the assets and are ready to talk. We get it. We've been building <span class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold">high-performing lead systems</span> for years (home services first, now insurance), and we built something so you don't have to hunt alone.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					We use AI to find people 55–77 with $100K+ ready to roll over and a recent life event that's got them thinking about annuities. Then we verify they're real, get them to opt in, and only send you <span class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold">exclusive prospects in your licensed states</span>. You get a steady pipeline. You close. We handle the rest.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Our job is to put the right people in front of you. Your job is to do what you're best at. If that sounds like the partnership you've been looking for, we'd love to talk.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
					<div class="about-stat-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] shadow-sm">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">$100K+</div>
						<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Annuity Opportunities</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-stat-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 shadow-sm">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">55–77</div>
						<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Retirement Window</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-stat-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 shadow-sm">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">Verified</div>
						<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">OTP + Opt-In</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-stat-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 shadow-sm">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">Exclusive</div>
						<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Your Prospects Only</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="reveal">
				<div class="about-different-box bg-gradient-to-br from-[#eff6ff] to-[#dbeafe] rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] shadow-sm">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 gradient-text">What You Get When We Work Together</h3>
					<ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
						<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
							<span class="text-[#1e40af]">✓</span>
							<span><strong class="text-gray-900">A steady pipeline</strong> of qualified prospects, exclusive to you, every day.</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
							<span class="text-blue-600">✓</span>
							<span><strong class="text-gray-900">Only your states.</strong> We only send you people you're licensed to work. No wasted leads.</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
							<span class="text-blue-600">✓</span>
							<span><strong class="text-gray-900">Prospects who are already warm.</strong> We get them thinking about annuities before they reach you. You step in and close.</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
							<span class="text-blue-600">✓</span>
							<span><strong class="text-gray-900">A partner who gets it.</strong> We're looking for producers who want to win. If that's you, we're here to help you get there.</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

